{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pulls/144","id":5306490480,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVnCdCs8AAAABPEqecA","html_url":"https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pull/144","diff_url":"https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pull/144.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pull/144.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/issues/144","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pulls/144/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pulls/144/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/issues/144/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lorek666/tianshu-agent/statuses/9413c7ca66af56fce8ac1664e989cf8cd6fc9808","number":144,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(admission): enforce low-disk run policy across entrypoints","user":{"login":"lorek666","id":265249269,"node_id":"U_kgDOD89h9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265249269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666","html_url":"https://github.com/lorek666","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 为什么改\n\nPRD要求可用空间低于2 GiB时拒绝新的副作用Run，同时保留合法读取、模型恢复和停止控制。\n本片把这一限制落实到真实创建/派发/执行位置，并让用户显式选择effects或pure_only，避免入口承诺与执行规则脱节。\n\n## 范围\n\n- 严格版本化RunExecutionPolicyV1；仅run.start新写payload v2，历史v0/v1读取与回放保留。\n- 实际DB/payload/snapshot/memory/workspace/authority/execution.guard位置现测；低盘与未知分开拒绝。\n- 创建事务原子拒绝；普通非pure在审批前、一次消费前、intent与实际执行边界复核；读/模型/既有停止例外保留原规则。\n- CLI、真实daemon IPC和UI新建/详情两条启动路径传递同一资格；失败重试保留选择，不改变workspace权限或升级旧Run。\n- 修正Loop过早过滤导致原拒绝审计与父版本fence被跳过的回归；原AUTH/eval/fence和硬退exit77断言保留。\n- 真实代码/schema/PRD共同登记三项拒绝；历史红灯、负控、观察器错误与精确字节公开子集均保留。\n\n## 当前验证身份与状态\n\n正式head：`9413c7ca66af56fce8ac1664e989cf8cd6fc9808`；tree：`73558d71cbce08e8d5a86aa8fce26cd89f476d3b`；parent：`96e3e485eb4ecbecadbadb54a60414967ab63649`。当前1066路径映射SHA256为`d7f721394020a86ff03e99146131539c82a8437cc4a5b68aab4a37086b81608c`。\n\n- 旧head `96e3e485eb4ecbecadbadb54a60414967ab63649` 首次原生 [run43549430150 attempt1](https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/actions/runs/43549430150/attempts/1) 已结束且失败：Ubuntu/macOS/UI/Windows片0成功，Windows片1两红（2 failed / 1568 passed / 25 skipped，580.92s）及required汇总失败。完整六job、两artifact原件保全，采集errors=[]不是测试通过。\n- 新head只追加两测试、两份事实文档及36件明确公开证据。真实子进程READY/GO改用现有CHILD_TEXT协议；保留原所有成功/暂停/errors断言，将正常收尾6次增至60次，失败时显示实际run.end、迭代号、worker.errors和事件类型。生产、schema、CI、门禁、锁与57项UI输入均不变。**心跳根因未复现、未修复**，不把诊断变成修复结论。\n- 本机完整门绑定1030源清单`2922a34503134aa6674c905dffc016b87a839687cb41ec66dbed6839a1448bc9`：lock/full/全仓ruff均exit0，**3183 passed / 8 skipped，513.63s**；source/HEAD/status前后稳定。其后仅两docs与36份文档证据发生变化，另外1028项身份精确继承，未重复未变UI。\n- 第二读者`/root/review_low_disk_integration`：两测试窄审 `PASS_NARROW_TWO_TEST_DIAGNOSTIC_DELTA_NOT_HEARTBEAT_FIX`；原目标2项通过、真实DB回查60 succeeded/1 paused；强制真实子进程CRLF正控1项通过；坏READY及reason注入各在原call断言真红。REPORT SHA256 `55e15a3eba65b6e0b7ed0c65925a27291a633bc6e96dbb48b3ea745491fd575a`，facts `97ae21e2a9834957d29fd44c915e2dffd5a30f24958ffb1f14842771de126684`；macOS离线探针，不是Windows实跑。\n- 最终事实/tree/公开子集独立窄核 `PASS_STATIC_FINAL_DIAGNOSTIC_TREE_FACTS_AND_SUBSET_BINDING_ONLY`：tree/1066paths/40delta、34原字节+2导航全集与本机原件均核对通过。REPORT `09e2110a003946e3c1ec34423fbeb5da338416a83815ba9cefc64782d90b8ffd`，facts `4cc71ae04788a70f3f090861a5c92c3c5640fc8d6a5c9631f80265891bf46f1b`，index `244b83ccdcb6b9e31ca460a887edf68189b0c148c16c9ecd444f0342a489a569`。正式SHA另由同读者确认 `PASS_FORMAL_COMMIT_BINDING_TO_REVIEWED_DIAGNOSTIC_TREE_ONLY`：REPORT `857769a70c3df6e08d8cd2afe5c7bc1888d64b1ba6604c848c6ef8b81b26ad15`、facts `aa683e9d78c70f715a9eef54c7874a50c5c4b85e7e24672af381380c4eb36968`、index `5a00384a527932fcf7403cd82d769c66d79f95d77a0222f24d187ffe773f5fbe`；同tree继承而非重跑，也不冒称云端批准。\n- 新head原生 [run43553215035 attempt1](https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/actions/runs/43553215035/attempts/1) 已完整成功：六job/70steps/四required均success，实际checkout `7dc2ea1142bbf74d020b14dde3111df3d9f4711f` 的tree与上述正式head完全一致，有序parents为main `a0223aa269efcdf70df4c4d8c43e5629b4fa0215`、正式head。Ubuntu **3178 passed/13 skipped/481.53s**，macOS **3183/8/675.92s**；Windows片0 **1584/12/1154.38s**、片1 **1570/25/616.17s**，合3154 passed/37 skipped，3191完整有序collection分为1596/1595且全部阶段覆盖。UI **13文件/91测试**、install/typecheck/build/dist一致性均通过。Windows是Server2025 x86_64/Python3.12.16 runner；三次PYTHON STACK WATCHDOG后相应用例均PASS，6条Node20 warning/4条平台notice/0 failure，原skip与GIL边界保留。没有rerun覆盖旧红、取消原run或改四required/25分钟上限。\n- 第二读者新原生结论 **PASS_NATIVE_CI_9413_COMPLETE_EVIDENCE_ONLY_WITH_UNRESOLVED_145**：直接核48原件、artifact ZIP字节digest/单成员/3191有序覆盖、六job/70step和fresh保护/PR/main/tree/parents，当前CI证据及两测试delta无新增具体阻断。REPORT SHA256 `2be26b81e4a28d46039197136b83896d94218cb6209d3ab493602bd9f7a1bbf5`，facts `4c5fe315de2dbd93f212954f262f2d444a1bdad71be9c6a4376d57864e241329`，index `2ea0b6df2269572f1608b72e3f4c7e6b2792bfed3bcd1665ebb4a17ede8ef6d7`。原114件CI与15件独立包按字节保全ignored归档；该限定报告不给无条件整PR合并批准。\n- 新增证据原字节7处尾空白保留（staged diffcheck exit2），非evidence检查0；没有放宽lint/ignore。此前906/T1/T2/T3内容和96e3对象结论按各自精确身份继承，旧41failed本机结果、旧原生失败和旧PARTIAL均保留。\n\n[交付记录](https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/blob/9413c7ca66af56fce8ac1664e989cf8cd6fc9808/docs/LOW-DISK-2026-11-14.md)与[本次公开子集](https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/blob/9413c7ca66af56fce8ac1664e989cf8cd6fc9808/docs/evidence/low-disk-2026-11-14/pr144-diagnostic/README.md)明确列出未公开临时DB/完整包边界。\n\n## 本次内部研发交付裁定\n\nroot在用户已授权自主处理的范围内接纳带已知风险交付：低盘内容独立验收、当前精确head的更强原断言和四required全部通过；生产不按未证实的锁假说修改。[issue #145](https://github.com/lorek666/tianshu-agent/issues/145) 保持open，旧正常收尾Run failed原因未知、未修复，不能证成baseline，也不能排除本PR回归。本次选择交付低磁盘切片并继续追踪该可靠性风险；这是root的工程取舍，不冒称第二读者已无条件批准或故障已消失。关闭145仍须实际原因、受控真实回归、修复、独立核验及新正式提交原生CI。普通保护合并后还须核main自身push CI，当前没有将PR CI冒充main CI。\n\n## 未决与边界\n\n- 原Windows正常收尾Run failed根因仍未解。新诊断和本机60次绿不销账旧红，需新原生结果和实际reason继续判断；没有run.end时诊断不能保证reason。\n- **BASE-B1仍未修**：基线CLI引擎未装配stack.budget；本片不扩写预算修复，不外推其他入口预算证据。\n- 受控空间probe不是配额或空间预留；真实跨卷/嵌套挂载、整卷ENOSPC和断电尚未验证。\n- 恢复隔离/受管apply、容量与执行GC、真实付费模型、10h soak、凭据设置和普通用户发行属于后续批次。\n- CI runner不替代Windows 10/11、ARM64或用户桌面安装体验。本PR只交付低磁盘切片，不宣称G3全部完成。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T03:01:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:13:32Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T04:13:29Z","merged_at":"2026-11-14T04:13:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"8f2a508e68f27efc4100b7466fcd79043341f7fa","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"lorek666:codex/g3-low-disk-admission","ref":"codex/g3-low-disk-admission","repo":{"id":1450220810,"node_id":"R_kgDOVnCdCg","name":"tianshu-agent","full_name":"lorek666/tianshu-agent","owner":{"login":"lorek666","id":265249269,"node_id":"U_kgDOD89h9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265249269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666","html_url":"https://github.com/lorek666","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorek666